    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isnt just a narrative? what if it actually is true? like, if i stayed, i'd just keep costing them everything. and if i wasn't around, they'd eventually be able to breathe again. it almost feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to just stop being a problem for them.",
