      "content": "The idea that your absence would bring them peace is a dangerously tempting thought, but it's a lie that only despair can whisper. You are not a problem; you are a person who is hurting, and that pain is real. If you truly believe you are a burden, that's a symptom of the depth of your suffering, not a factual assessment of your worth. Please, let someone help you see past this dark illusion.",
